From 9231ea0716bf1e74242ea4edbbde8b2c54a25fb7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Upstream Draft <draft@example.invalid>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 05:50:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(heartbeat): merge issue override env per key

An issue override that contains env replaces the complete env object of
the agent config at run time. The agent loses every key that the override
does not repeat. Merge env per key so a task-level override can set one
environment key and keep the agent credentials.

Preserve an explicit non-object env (including null) as a clearing
operation. Reject an override env key that shares a case-insensitive
name with any base key, before secret resolution, unless the base
carries exactly that one spelling.
---
